{'symbol': 'AVB', 'date': '2023-04-20 12:51:00', 'title': "AVALONBAY COMMUNITIES, INC.'S CUSTOMER CARE CENTER PROVIDES BACK-OFFICE SERVICES TO GABLES RESIDENTIAL", 'text': "ARLINGTON, VA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AVALONBAY COMMUNITIES, INC. (NYSE: AVB) AND GABLES RESIDENTIAL ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THEY HAVE ENTERED INTO A THIRD-PARTY SERVICING AGREEMENT FOR AVALONBAY'S CENTRALIZED SERVICE CENTER TO PROVIDE COMPREHENSIVE BACK-OFFICE, FINANCIAL ADMINISTRATIVE SUPPORT SERVICES TO GABLES RESIDENTIAL."}